{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DQA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0002": "$f_1, f_2 : R \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$g : S \\to S'$", "MATH_0004": "$g \\circ f_1$", "MATH_0005": "$g \\circ f_2$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-homotopic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:479ef76d50de116db15e439d93af62821b6328fde0abdb4aea7b50a50e0e8a0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a0f807fd1c565cf545252692e4a71686b1504c1bdeff30b853377b890cd7fbfd", "source_text": "In the category <MATH_0001>, if <MATH_0002>\nare formally homotopic and <MATH_0003> is a morphism, then\n<MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are formally homotopic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a0fbe48f995f0de5cca4fedcfcef38a696bda1828f9c6f469bfcfc4855e1ccc2", "unit_id": "tag:0DQC:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DQA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(r, h, k)$", "MATH_0002": "$f_1$", "MATH_0003": "$f_2$", "MATH_0004": "$(r, h, g \\circ k)$", "MATH_0005": "$g \\circ f_1$", "MATH_0006": "$g \\circ f_2$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ee720879458b8d687c01afc5106e6ad104084c77c89bd693b4a826c3b6a391aa", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:802aed39516598976874406377dcd05b1071856f99908e4ce8e6ebebd45a7d63", "source_text": "Namely, if <MATH_0001> is a formal homotopy between <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003>, then\n<MATH_0004> is a formal homotopy between <MATH_0005> and\n<MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bdec344e61620d7be91a0dc669de9e8f2bd176e2fd295e44405c5a9d0ad1e797", "unit_id": "tag:0DQC:proof"}
